1
00:00:00,560 --> 00:00:02,360
Time for a timeline cleanse.

2
00:00:02,660 --> 00:00:08,320
Let's take it back to when I was in Belize with my homegirl, Janice, having a fabulous time.

3
00:00:09,320 --> 00:00:15,640
So I stayed at Itzana down in Placencia, and the decor was majestic.

4
00:00:16,260 --> 00:00:20,000
Then we head outside, and they put the same energy into the pool and the landscaping.

5
00:00:20,380 --> 00:00:22,460
Oh, look at her. Fabulous.

6
00:00:22,820 --> 00:00:23,700
Look at this fish!

7
00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:27,400
Everyone loves coconut water in an actual coconut.

8
00:00:28,360 --> 00:00:29,400
And you know what else we love?

9
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:30,660
Rest and relaxation.

10
00:00:31,620 --> 00:00:36,220
See, in the constant fight that we're in right now, you've got to still find time to take your joy when you can.

11
00:00:36,460 --> 00:00:39,040
And for me, it's to be by the ocean and with the sea.

12
00:00:44,070 --> 00:00:45,650
So here's the room that we stayed in.

13
00:00:46,670 --> 00:00:48,990
Walk up these stairs, and you know what?

14
00:00:49,130 --> 00:00:50,050
Let's just head on outside.

15
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:51,390
Yes, buddy!

16
00:00:52,150 --> 00:00:52,490
Yeah!

17
00:01:04,460 --> 00:01:05,920
Nothing like a Belizean sunset.

18
00:01:06,300 --> 00:01:07,880
I always say the sky is bigger here.

19
00:01:08,500 --> 00:01:10,320
If you get a chance, you should see it too.

